{"title": "Councillors from BJP and LDF Clash in Thiruvananthapuram Corporation", "summary": "Councillors representing the Bharatiya Janata Party (BJP) and the Left Democratic Front (LDF), specifically the CPI(M), were involved in a physical altercation at the Thiruvananthapuram Corporation. The clash prompted intervention from the police, who subsequently registered cases against the councillors from both parties. This incident highlights political tensions within the local governing body.", "summary_points": ["BJP and LDF (CPI(M)) councillors clashed at the Thiruvananthapuram Corporation.", "The incident involved physical confrontation between members of the two political parties.", "Police intervened to manage the situation.", "Cases were registered by the police against councillors from both the BJP and CPI(M)."], "title_hi": "तिरुवनंतपुरम निगम में भाजपा और एलडीएफ पार्षदों के बीच झड़प", "summary_hi": "भारतीय जनता पार्टी (भाजपा) और लेफ्ट डेमोक्रेटिक फ्रंट (एलडीएफ), विशेष रूप से सीपीआई (एम) का प्रतिनिधित्व करने वाले पार्षद तिरुवनंतपुरम निगम में एक शारीरिक झड़प में शामिल थे। इस झड़प के कारण पुलिस को हस्तक्षेप करना पड़ा, जिसने बाद में दोनों दलों के पार्षदों के खिलाफ मामले दर्ज किए। यह घटना स्थानीय शासी निकाय के भीतर राजनीतिक तनाव को उजागर करती है।", "summary_points_hi": ["भाजपा और एलडीएफ (सीपीआई(एम)) पार्षदों के बीच तिरुवनंतपुरम निगम में झड़प हुई।", "इस घटना में दोनों राजनीतिक दलों के सदस्यों के बीच शारीरिक टकराव शामिल था।", "पुलिस ने स्थिति को नियंत्रित करने के लिए हस्तक्षेप किया।", "पुलिस ने भाजपा और सीपीआई(एम) दोनों के पार्षदों के खिलाफ मामले दर्ज किए।"], "framing": {"center": "Centrist outlets report the clash between BJP and LDF/CPI(M) councillors in Thiruvananthapuram Corporation, noting police intervention and the booking of councillors from both parties."}, "framing_hi": {"center": "केंद्र-leaning आउटलेट तिरुवनंतपुरम निगम में भाजपा और एलडीएफ/सीपीआई(एम) पार्षदों के बीच झड़प की रिपोर्ट करते हैं, जिसमें पुलिस के हस्तक्षेप और दोनों दलों के पार्षदों के खिलाफ मामला दर्ज करने का उल्लेख है।"}, "topic": "Politics", "region": "India", "image_url": "https://th-i.thgim.com/public/news/national/kerala/i5czni/article71140778.ece/alternates/LANDSCAPE_1200/Kerala%20HC%20%20%20-%20R%20K%20Nithin.jpg", "sources": [{"source": "The Hindu", "lean": "left", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/kerala/kerala-hc-invalidates-oaths-taken-in-names-other-than-god-or-solemn-affirmation/article71140771.ece", "headline": "Kerala High Court invalidates oaths of 20 Thiruvananthapuram councillors, orders fresh swearing-in"}, {"source": "The Hindu", "lean": "left", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/kerala/bjp-in-tricky-spot-in-thiruvananthapuram-corporation-as-20-councillors-including-kaapa-accused-r-sugathan-asked-to-retake-oath/article71141076.ece", "headline": "BJP in tricky spot in Thiruvananthapuram Corporation as 20 councillors, including KAAPA accused R. Sugathan, asked to retake oath"}, {"source": "The Indian Express", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://indianexpress.com/article/india/kerala-bjp-councillors-oath-names-deities-martyrs-high-court-10754981", "headline": "Kerala BJP councillors took oath in names of deities, martyrs. High Court didn’t agree"}, {"source": "The Times of India", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/only-in-gods-name-kerala-hc-invalidates-bjp-councillors-oaths-taken-in-names-of-deities-mother-india/articleshow/131960697.cms", "headline": "'Only in God's name': HC invalidates BJP councillors' oaths in names of deities, 'Mother India'"}, {"source": "Satya Hindi", "lean": "left", "language": "hi", "url": "https://www.satyahindi.com/kerala/kerala-hc-invalidates-bjp-councillors-oath-in-name-of-deities-martyrs-154199.html", "headline": "केरल हाई कोर्ट ने देवताओं, शहीदों के नाम पर ली गई बीजेपी पार्षदों की शपथ को रद्द किया"}, {"source": "The News Minute", "lean": "left", "language": "en", "url": "https://